SUMMARY:2773 - Date Night: Mastering Sushi
DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Cat Alwine for a fun and interactive date night exploring the art of sushi making. Guests will learn essential sushi techniques including preparing sushi rice\, rolling maki and hand rolls\, and shaping nigiri while working together to create a beautiful assortment of classic Japanese favorites. \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 18 and up.*Tickets are priced per person. Gluten Free \n\nSalmon Maki Rolls\nCalifornia Uramaki\nTamago & Salmon Nigiri\nImitation Crab & Veggie Temaki Hand Rolls
