SUMMARY:2775 - Brisket Masterclass
DESCRIPTION:Join Pit-Master Jeremy Losino for a hands-on barbecue masterclass focused on the art of smoked brisket. Guests will learn essential techniques including trimming\, seasoning\, smoking\, temperature control\, and slicing while gaining tips and tricks for achieving tender\, flavorful results at home. \nDemo. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. \n\nBrisket\nTexas Style Bbq Sauce\nQuick Pickled Red Onions\nSourdough Discard Cheddar Bay Biscuits\nSmoked Brisket Tallow Chocolate Chip Cookies
