SUMMARY:2776 - Sourdough 101
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Sourdough 101 with our instructor\, Mike Wetherhold! Known for his amazing sourdough\, Mike is eager to teach you the art of crafting this beloved bread. In this class\, you will learn how to create and maintain your sourdough starter\, master the process from start to finish baking two delicious loaves of bread\, and take home a starter kit to continue baking on your own. Expect plenty of Q&A time and Mike’s signature dad jokes to keep you entertained throughout this informative workshop\nDemonstration. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. \n\nHow to create and Maintain your Sourdough Starter\nLearn the process from Start to Finish to make two loaves\nTaste different sourdough with delicious butter and jams\nTake-home kit with active sourdough starter and everything you need to make fresh bread
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2776-sourdough-101/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 1180 Erbs Quarry Road\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,Healthy Eating,Let's Bake,Masterclass,Vegetarian
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://zestchef.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/sourdough-101-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
