DESCRIPTION:Discover the art of creating rich\, flavorful dairy-free cheeses from nuts and seeds in this hands-on class with Shawn Borup. Guests will learn techniques for blending\, seasoning\, and crafting versatile plant-based spreads and cheeses perfect for entertaining\, snacking\, and everyday cooking. \nPartial Hands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. *Dairy Free. Gluten Free. Vegetarian.  \n\n• Cashew Parmesan Cheese\n• Cashew Cream Cheese\n• Cashew Cheddar Cheese\n• Almond Ricotta\n• Seed Crackers
