DESCRIPTION:Escape to the tropics in this hands-on baking class with Faith Kennedy featuring bright citrus flavors\, juicy pineapple\, and sweet mango-inspired desserts perfect for summer gatherings. Guests will learn baking and decorating techniques while creating beautiful seasonal treats with a tropical twist. \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. *Vegetarian \n\n• Coconut Lime Cookies\n• Pineapple Upside-Down Mini Cakes\n• Mango Glaze Drizzle
