SUMMARY:2787 - Red\, White & Ready: July 4th Make & Take
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for the Fourth of July in this hands-on make & take barbecue class with Pit-Master Jeremy Losino. Guests will prepare smoky barbecue favorites and classic summer sides to take home and enjoy for the holiday weekend –  no grocery shopping or cleanup required. \n*Each ticket includes a complete meal serving for approximately 4 people to take home. \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. \n\n• Pulled Pork with BBQ sauce\n• Homemade Potato Salad\n• Street Food Corn Slaw\n• Buttermilk Spicy Honey Cornbread Muffins
